          "short": "$\\cos2A\\cos3B-\\sin2A\\sin3B$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\cos(2A+3B)&=\\cos2A\\cos3B\\\\&\\quad-\\sin2A\\sin3B\\end{aligned}$$",
