          "short": "$\\cos\\theta\\cos\\frac{\\phi}{2}+\\sin\\theta\\sin\\frac{\\phi}{2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\cos\\left(\\theta-\\frac{\\phi}{2}\\right)&=\\cos\\theta\\cos\\frac{\\phi}{2}\\\\&\\quad+\\sin\\theta\\sin\\frac{\\phi}{2}\\end{aligned}$$",
